<title>UK: Sachsen LB adds 500 mln marks to July 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Sachsen LB adds 500 mln marks to July 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SACHSEN LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    01.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    14.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   17.5 BP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   SPREAD	-2 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.875 PCT 2003 TREUHAND</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 90</p>
<p>		*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN DEM ON 13.MAR.97</p>
<p>		**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
